<title>USA: Fansteel says large shareholder dies.</title>
<headline>Fansteel says large shareholder dies.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH CHICAGO, Ill. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fansteel Inc said Friday that Thomas Mellon Evans, the holder of 47 percent of the company's common stock, died yesterday at the age of 86.</p>
<p>Fansteel, a specialty metals manufacturer, reported 1996 sales of $120.8 million.</p>
